# Binaries. `make build` writes into bin/, but a plain
# `go build ./cmd/fox` drops the binary here under the command's own name --
# and a 24 MB one was committed that way once, which broke the repository-wide
# scans by matching retired names inside its own string table. The names are
# listed rather than globbed because most files here have no extension either.
/bin/
/fox
/fox-enterprise
/fox-verify
/foxbyte
*.exe

# Go
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Local data / logs
/data/
*.log

# Personal env overrides
.env.local

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# web app
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
/dist/
# The published clients build the same way. node_modules and dist were not
# covered here, and a `npm install` run to execute the client tests put the
# whole TypeScript compiler into a commit.
clients/typescript/node_modules/
clients/typescript/dist/
# Python build and test artefacts beside the client.
clients/python/**/__pycache__/
clients/python/*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# SSH keys never belong in the repository
id_ed*
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
*.pem

# The release signing key (cmd/releasesign) belongs in the Actions secret and a password manager
release-signing.key
license-signing.key
/eval-licences/
